From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:27:26 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Show friendly 404/500 pages without stack trace outside
 development

ErrorsHandler::viewFor() picks errors/404 or errors/500 unless APP_ENV
is development (read from $_ENV at handling time, default production).
The views are plain HTML without layout, with a link back home.
